:: Campus Front Courtyard
<<initPlayState>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-front-courtyard", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<run School.ensure()>>\
<<if Player.isYounger() && School.isSchoolDay()>>\
You stand in the front courtyard of Linkon University. The overarching clock tower reads <<= World.formatTime()>>.<<if !World.isBefore(7, 0) && World.isBefore(9, 0)>> Class starts at <<= World.formatTimeAt(9, 0)>>.<</if>>
<<else>>\
You stand in the front courtyard of Linkon University.
<</if>>

<<icon "linkon-university">><<link "Enter the school <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
<<actionIcon "entrance">><<link "Rear courtyard <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Campus Rear Courtyard">><</link>>

<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave campus <span class='action-time'>(0:03)</span>">><<run World.advance(3)>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</link>>
